          "id": "a",
          "text": "$0$",
          "isCorrect": true
        },
        {
          "id": "b",
          "text": "$1$",
          "isCorrect": false
        },
        {
          "id": "c",
          "text": "$+\\infty$",
          "isCorrect": false
        },
        {
          "id": "d",
          "text": "$e$",
          "isCorrect": false
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Croissance comparée : le logarithme croît beaucoup moins vite que toute puissance positive. $\\frac{\\ln x}{x} \\xrightarrow{+\\infty} 0$."
    },
    {
      "id": "med-22-02",
      "type": "mcq",
      "theme": "analyse",
      "category": "Dérivation",
      "difficulty": "concours",
      "prompt": "Le nombre de solutions de $e^x = 3x$ sur $\\mathbb{R}$ est :",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "a",
          "text": "$2$",
          "isCorrect": true
        },
        {
          "id": "b",
          "text": "$0$",
          "isCorrect": false
        },
        {
          "id": "c",
          "text": "$1$",
          "isCorrect": false
        },
        {
          "id": "d",
          "text": "$3$",
          "isCorrect": false
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Soit $g(x) = e^x - 3x$. $g'(x)=0 \\Leftrightarrow x = \\ln 3$. $g(\\ln 3)=3-3\\ln 3 < 0$. Avec $\\displaystyle \\lim_{\\pm\\infty}g=+\\infty$, le TVI donne $2$ racines."
    },
    {
