      ],
      "explanation": "Linéarisation : $\\sin^2 x = \\frac{(1-\\cos 2x)}{2}$. $I = \\frac{1}{2}[x-\\frac{\\sin 2x}{2}]_0^\\pi = \\frac{\\pi}{2}$."
    },
